  "steps": [
    "Dice the onion and mince the garlic.",
    "Heat oil in a wide pan over high heat. Add turkey mince and cook for 4–5 min, breaking it up until browned.",
    "Add onion and garlic, cook 2 min until softened.",
    "Stir in tomato paste and herbs, pour in passata. Simmer for 5 min.",
